 there  you go that's work capacity those are a  few ways you can increase it let me know  in the comments down below if I missed  anything you have any cool tips for  boosting work capacity I mean take home  from this that I think is just to make  sure your training work capacity your  new form is burning through more power  than your body can supply you should  have waited until you were used to this  form and knew how to regulate it before  you started picking fights a lot of  people ignore it but it's the difference  between being fit and strong or just  strong and out of shape  thanks a ton for watching I've got lots  more stuff on the way suit I've been  doing my Knightly training I've got  video coming on increasing jump heights  I've got video coming on Shaolin  training with all that sounds awesome  then thanks a ton for watching and I'll  see you next time bye for now  you

